sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Op as Operador
    participant UI as Angular (vista Celdas)
    participant P as ParkingSpotCRUDController
    participant S as ParkingSpotDomainService
    participant DB as ParkingSpotRepository / MySQL
    Op->>UI: Crea, edita o elimina una celda
    UI->>P: POST / PUT / DELETE /parking-spot
    P->>S: createOrUpdate / delete
    S->>DB: Celda FOR UPDATE y buscar número
    alt Número de celda duplicado
        P-->>UI: 409 Celda duplicada
    else Celda ocupada (editar o eliminar)
        P-->>UI: 409 Celda ocupada
    else Operación válida
        S->>DB: Persistir cambio
        P-->>UI: 200 / 204
        UI-->>Op: Estado de celdas actualizado
    end
